<ui-nav title="2-back 测试" />
<view class="task-page ai-copilot-safe-space"><view class="task-content">
  <view class="task-heading"><text class="task-kicker">空间工作记忆更新</text><text class="task-title">2-back 测试</text><text class="task-subtitle">判断当前位置是否与前两次出现的位置相同</text></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:if="{{phase === 'intro' || phase === 'paused'}}"><text class="section-title">测试说明</text><text class="instruction">记住每次亮起的方格位置。如果当前位置与两次之前相同，选择“匹配”；否则选择“不匹配”。前两次用于建立记忆。</text><view class="notice">正式序列控制目标比例和位置分布，避免连续位置形成提示。</view><text wx:if="{{phase === 'paused'}}" class="paused-text">本项已中断，需要重新开始</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="startTest">开始测试</button></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'testing' || phase === 'interval'}}"><view class="progress-row"><text>第 {{currentTrial}} / {{totalTrials}} 题</text><text>{{progressPercent}}%</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-value" style="{{'width:' + progressPercent + '%;'}}"></view></view><view class="nback-grid"><view wx:for="{{grid}}" wx:key="index" class="nback-cell {{item.active ? 'nback-cell--active' : ''}}"></view></view><view class="answer-row"><button data-match="true" bindtap="handleAnswer">匹配</button><button data-match="false" bindtap="handleAnswer">不匹配</button></view></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'result'}}"><text class="section-title">结果摘要</text><view class="result-grid"><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.accuracy}}%</text><text class="result-label">正确率</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.d_prime}}</text><text class="result-label">辨别指数</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.hits}}</text><text class="result-label">命中</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.false_alarms}}</text><text class="result-label">虚报</text></view></view><text class="sync-status">{{syncStatus}}</text><button wx:if="{{syncStatus === '待同步'}}" class="primary-button" bindtap="retrySync">重新同步</button><button wx:if="{{mode === 'battery'}}" class="secondary-button" bindtap="goNext">继续完整评估</button><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="startTest">重新测试</button></view>
  <text class="medical-tip">本测试仅记录客观工作记忆指标，不替代专业医生诊断</text>
</view></view>
